                <code class="code-pill">fetch('/api/login')</code> or raw <code class="code-pill">XMLHttpRequest</code> with manual promise chaining.
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
                <code class="code-pill">HttpClient</code> with <strong>RxJS Observables:</strong> Type-safe reactive data streams with declarative error handling.
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);">UI Data Binding</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
                Manual DOM queries: <code class="code-pill">document.getElementById('name').value</code> and <code class="code-pill">innerHTML += '&lt;tr&gt;...'</code>.
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
                <strong>Two-way Data Binding:</strong> <code class="code-pill">[(ngModel)]</code>, reactive forms, and declarative templating (<code class="code-pill">*ngFor</code> / <code class="code-pill">@for</code>).
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);">Token Management</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
                Manually appending headers on every single fetch: <code class="code-pill">headers: &lbrace; 'Authorization': 'Bearer ' + token &rbrace;</code>.
              </td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
                <strong>Angular HTTP Interceptor:</strong> Centralized pipeline that automatically intercepts and attaches Bearer tokens application-wide.
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);">
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);">Route Protection</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
