              </td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
                <strong>Angular Route Guards (<code class="code-pill">CanActivateFn</code>):</strong> Declaratively prevents unauthenticated navigation before components load.
              </td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--text-primary);">Backend Architecture</td>
              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
