              <td style="padding: 0.75rem 1rem; color: var(--text-secondary);">
                <strong>Azure Functions (Java Serverless):</strong> Isolated, independently executed functions triggered by HTTP events (<code class="code-pill">@FunctionName</code>, <code class="code-pill">@HttpTrigger</code>).
              </td>
            </tr>
