<pre style="margin: 0; color: var(--text-primary);">
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
|                                    DATABASE SCHEMA                                      |
+-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+

  [ USERS ]                                           [ ROLES ]
  - id (PK, BigInt)                                   - id (PK, BigInt)
  - username (UK, Varchar)  &lt;----+                    - role_name (UK, Varchar) &lt;--+
  - password_hash (Varchar)      |                    - description (Varchar)      |
  - full_name (Varchar)          |                                                 |
  - email (Varchar)              |        [ USER_ROLES ]                           |
  - status (Varchar)             +------&gt; - user_id (FK -&gt; USERS.id)               |
  - created_at (Timestamp)                - role_id (FK -&gt; ROLES.id) --------------+
         |
         | (1:N creates)
         v
  [ STUDENTS ]
  - id (PK, BigInt)
  - student_code (UK, Varchar)
  - full_name (Varchar)
  - email (UK, Varchar)
  - phone (Varchar)
  - course (Varchar)
  - batch (Varchar)
  - status (Varchar: ENROLLED | GRADUATED | SUSPENDED)
  - created_by (FK -&gt; USERS.username)
  - created_at (Timestamp)

  [ USER_SESSIONS ]
  - session_id (PK, Varchar)
  - user_id (FK -&gt; USERS.id)
  - token_hash (Varchar)
  - issued_at (Timestamp)
  - expires_at (Timestamp)
  - is_revoked (Boolean)
</pre>
